### About

**About section**

```text
You're winning work. The lads are busy. The turnover is up. And you still don't really know where the profit's going.

That's the problem I fix.

I spent fifteen years in building services - started as a Project Engineer, came up through Contracts Manager, finished as Operations Director at Harlow & Pike Building Services. During that time I grew the HVAC division from £4.2m to £11.8m in five years. We did it by moving off one-off installs and onto planned maintenance contracts, and by getting properly into how we priced and tracked jobs so the margin held through the growth.

